' ============================================================
' Common bridges for an EPD
'
' A bridge stands between the model and one background dataset, so
' the choice of dataset sits in one place. Each pattern below has a
' FIND line to list the candidates and a BRIDGE block to fill in.
'
' How to use it: run the FIND lines, pick a process, paste its UUID
' into PROVIDER, take the apostrophes off the block and run it. While
' an EPD is active, bridges go into the EPD's Bridges folder.
'
' DATA says where the data comes from. Under a programme profile it
' is required on every bridge.
' ============================================================

' ------------------------------------------------------------
' Electricity
' The modelling approach is declared:
'   ELECTRICITY CONTRACT     backed by a contractual instrument
'   ELECTRICITY RESIDUAL     the residual mix of the market
'   ELECTRICITY CONSUMPTION  the consumption mix of the market
' Under PROGRAMME "IES" a consumption mix is refused in A1 to A3
' processes the manufacturer controls, and some countries need the
' mix of the grid region (REGION) and not the national one.
' LOCATION BASED PROVIDER names the consumption mix to use for the
' extra location-based results (EPD REPORT ... LOCATION BASED).
' ------------------------------------------------------------
FIND PROCESS "electricity" AT "GB"

' BRIDGE "Electricity", kWh
'   PROVIDER "uuid of the residual mix or the contracted supply"
'   ELECTRICITY RESIDUAL
'   COUNTRY "GB"
'   ENERGY SOURCE "Residual mix, United Kingdom"
'   LOCATION BASED PROVIDER "uuid of the consumption mix"
'   DATA PRIMARY SOURCE "Database" PROVIDER "ecoinvent 3.11" YEAR 2024
' END BRIDGE

' ------------------------------------------------------------
' Road transport (unit t*km: tonnes carried times kilometres)
' ------------------------------------------------------------
FIND PROCESS "transport, freight, lorry"

' BRIDGE "Road transport", t*km
'   PROVIDER "uuid of the lorry size and emission class used"
'   DATA SECONDARY SOURCE "Database" PROVIDER "ecoinvent 3.11" YEAR 2024
' END BRIDGE

' ------------------------------------------------------------
' Water
' ------------------------------------------------------------
FIND PROCESS "tap water"

' BRIDGE "Tap water", kg
'   PROVIDER "uuid of the water supply for the region"
'   DATA SECONDARY SOURCE "Database" PROVIDER "ecoinvent 3.11" YEAR 2024
' END BRIDGE

' ------------------------------------------------------------
' Landfill (a waste treatment: note WASTE after the unit)
' ------------------------------------------------------------
FIND PROCESS "sanitary landfill"

' BRIDGE "Landfill", kg WASTE
'   PROVIDER "uuid of the treatment for this waste"
'   DATA SECONDARY SOURCE "Database" PROVIDER "ecoinvent 3.11" YEAR 2024
' END BRIDGE

' ------------------------------------------------------------
' Incineration (a waste treatment)
' ------------------------------------------------------------
FIND PROCESS "municipal incineration"

' BRIDGE "Incineration", kg WASTE
'   PROVIDER "uuid of the treatment for this waste"
'   DATA SECONDARY SOURCE "Database" PROVIDER "ecoinvent 3.11" YEAR 2024
' END BRIDGE
